findings.ideal:
§11.1 made mechanism. The enumerator performs `choose(heads)` at the hole's term cell and unifies the head with the hole's type BEFORE its fields are chosen, so proof prunes at every step and ill-typed candidates are never built. Each field is a further choose. A policy handler (all-proven, first, ask) resumes once per option, each resumption a trail segment by S2's rule, and the tie is computed from two segments' trails as today.

Dependencies, each a named peer:
- capture at every position (task #159 / Hβ.lower.offspine-perform-is-the-frame-not-in-the-image); a choose inside the enumerator is E_ContinuationUncapturable today;
- the 13 ledgers' state kept in the trail (PLAN §11 5.5's verify/tighten banks as columns), so one install above the choice serves every resumption;
- (arena, offset) handles, so a segment's mints stop colliding after rollback (the push arm restores `next`, which is C6's own named limit).

Unlocks:
- durable search: the held resumptions are continuation records in the image, and persist = memcpy is built;
- the fused N-thread oracle: resumptions on threads with per-thread segments under 9.2;
- time-travel: a resumption's segment IS its diff;
- a compile suspended at its first unanswerable read and resumed when the answer arrives (RESIDUE 1546-1556: 'the compiled artifact is the memcpy'd continuation of the compile').
